  {
   "fieldname": "help_html",
   "fieldtype": "HTML",
   "label": "Help",
   "options": "<div style='font-family:monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:2'><b style='font-size:14px'>THERMAL FORMAT</b> &nbsp;<span style='color:#888'>— ESC/POS receipt printer</span><br>Uses the same tag system as Thermal Layout Template.<br><br><b>Alignment:</b> [C] [CENTER] &nbsp; [R] [RIGHT] &nbsp; [L] [LEFT]<br><b>Style:</b> [B]bold[/B] &nbsp; [U]underline[/U] &nbsp; [UU]double-u[/UU] &nbsp; [INV]inverted[/INV] &nbsp; [FLIP]flip[/FLIP] &nbsp; [FB]fontB[/FB]<br><b>Size:</b> [BIG]2x2[/BIG] &nbsp; [W2]wide[/W2] &nbsp; [H2]tall[/H2] &nbsp; [W:n]width n[/W:n] &nbsp; [H:n]height n[/H:n]<br><b>Lines:</b> [LINE] &nbsp; [SLINE] &nbsp; [DLINE] &nbsp; [RULE:char]<br><b>Control:</b> [CUT] &nbsp; [PCUT] &nbsp; [FEED:n] &nbsp; [DRAWER]<br><b>Barcodes:</b> [BARCODE:value:TYPE] &nbsp; [QR:value] &nbsp; [HEX:1B40]<br><b>Data:</b> {{ doc['items'] }} for child tables &nbsp; {{ doc.field_name }} for fields<br><br><hr><b style='font-size:14px'>PDF FORMAT</b> &nbsp;<span style='color:#888'>— any CUPS printer, generates PDF from ERPNext print format</span><br>Select a Print Format and optional Letter Head.<br>The document is rendered to PDF and sent directly to the chosen printer via IPP.<br>No template editing required — layout is controlled by the ERPNext Print Format designer.<br><br><hr><b style='font-size:14px'>BARCODE FORMAT</b> &nbsp;<span style='color:#888'>— ZPL (Zebra) or TSPL (TSC) label printer — raw bytes sent to printer</span><br>Write a Jinja template that renders to ZPL or TSPL code. Sent RAW to the printer.<br><br><b>ZPL basics:</b><br><pre style='margin:4px 0'>^XA                         label start\n^XZ                         label end\n^PW406                      print width in dots (203dpi: 1mm≈8dots)\n^LL240                      label length in dots\n^FO20,10^CF0,40^FD{{ doc.name }}^FS    text at x=20,y=10 size=40\n^FO20,60^BY2^BCN,80,Y,N,N^FD{{ doc.name }}^FS  Code128 barcode\n^FO20,60^BQN,2,5^FDQA,{{ doc.name }}^FS  QR code\n^FO20,10^GB366,1,2^FS       horizontal line</pre><br><b>Barcode commands:</b><br>^BC — Code128 &nbsp; ^BE — EAN-13 &nbsp; ^B3 — Code39 &nbsp; ^BQ — QR<br><br><b>Example (item label):</b><br><pre style='margin:4px 0'>^XA\n^PW406^LL240\n^FO20,15^CF0,35^FD{{ doc.item_name[:24] }}^FS\n^FO20,60^CF0,25^FDRs.{{ doc.standard_rate }}^FS\n^FO200,15^BQN,2,5^FDQA,{{ doc.item_code }}^FS\n^XZ</pre></div>"
  }
